{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/12/04/111203_191722.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/12/04/111202_213747.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちわかつき(｀_´)ゞ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どうも、北海道の吹雪で昨日まさかの飛行機が遅れ、お土産を大量に購入した、若月です。時間がたっぷり出来たので調子に乗りました。はい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"北海道のイベントにいらして下さったみなさん(σ*´∀｀)!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございました♪"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/12/04/dimg0251.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"駅構内ということでみなさんとの距離がとても近く、沢山の声援をいただき若月は終始テンション高山でした(*´｀*)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/12/04/dimg0166.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、私たちのことを今回初めて知って下さった片や、名前だけ知っていて今回が初見!!という方が沢山いらっしゃってて、本当に嬉しい限りでしたΣ(ノд<)お１人だけでも私達乃木坂46の存在を知っていただけたら、今回のイベントは成功だと思っていたので、本当に沢山の方がいらしてくださり、大成功で終わることが出来ました!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大阪、名古屋に引き続き"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"北海道も優しい方々ばかりで、街も良いところで最高でした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/12/04/dimg0256.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また大きくなった乃木坂46全員で北海道に行きたいですね♪(/ω＼*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さてさて、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本日のブログ内容はですねぇ…"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"若月が逆に質問しちゃうぞ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/12/04/dimg0178.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/12/04/dimg0181.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"というわけで、皆さんに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"質問をしちゃいたいと思うわけですよ(*´｀*)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/12/04/dimg0182.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"答えてくれるカナ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/12/04/dimg0234.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"↑かなりんのを頂き(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さっそく！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ１:お住みの地域はどの辺ですか？もう12月ですが、寒いですか？(私の素朴な質問なので〜地方という答え方で全然大丈夫です^^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ２:地域オススメのスポットや食べ物ってありますか"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/12/04/dimg0171.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ３:足の裏がかゆい。でも、沢山の人がいる電車…しかもブーツ…さぁ、どうする"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/12/04/dimg0267.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/12/04/dimg0190.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ４:ワカツキ、みゅうみゅう、どっちが呼びやすい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/12/04/dimg0093.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"？(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ５:乃木坂46の存在は何がきっかけで知りましたか"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/12/04/dimg0179.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ６:若月に一言(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"という項目にしましたが、答えていただける範囲や質問だけで良いので是非教えてください"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/12/04/dimg0110.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/12/04/dimg0099.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんが私のことをもっと知りたいと言ってくださるように、私も同じようにもっともっとみなさんのことを知りたいしお話も聞きたいです♪(/ω＼*)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/